<title>USA: Glendale SD, Pa., won by Prudential Securities.</title>
<headline>Glendale SD, Pa., won by Prudential Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc said it won $3 million of Glendale School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series of 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.279 percent.</p>
</text>
